{"case_id": "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q11", "domain": "family", "question": "命主出身及家庭情况？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据八字分析，命主日主己土，生于辰月，印星丙丁双透，杀印相生。年柱癸亥为偏财父星，被月干丙火正印紧贴相克，且地支亥卯半合木局再生火克水，父星受损严重，显示早年丧父之象。原局月支辰中藏戊土劫财，男命以劫财为姐妹，无比肩，故有一姐，命主为弟。印星旺盛有力，母亲刚强能干，能继承家业并坚守。大运未交前以月柱丙辰为运，1986年丙寅，岁运并临丙火克癸水，流年寅木合去亥水之根，父星连根拔除，故该年父亲去世。母亲丙火印星得旺，守寡持家，符合命局。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q11", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 95348, "response_id": "38900ea8-d1cd-4301-b09c-0aa01be00d82", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 284, "completion_tokens": 4687, "total_tokens": 4971, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 4489}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 28}}
{"case_id": "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q12", "domain": "career", "question": "命主的样貌、性情、爱好及职业？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，命主日主己土生于辰月，得月令但被两重卯木七杀夹克，杀旺身弱。年柱癸亥财星生杀，加重攻身之力；月时丙丁火印星透出，形成杀印相生之局。七杀主压力、叛逆与肢体损伤，印星主文化艺术与才华。卯木为四肢，七杀重叠攻身，易有腿脚之疾；印星化杀，则爱好转向艺术与音乐，丙丁火为文明之象，符合古典音乐属性。偏财癸水透年干，主艺术才情与对异性之喜好。整体契合萨克斯乐手及乐团老板之职业，且腿脚残疾符合七杀为患的特征。其余选项或与身弱杀旺不符（如B身强健康），或与用神取向矛盾（如C好勇斗狠缺乏印星转化，D园艺属木为忌神）。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q12", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 37317, "response_id": "72879ac7-f404-44b8-97fc-3aa88a70f28e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 282, "completion_tokens": 1975, "total_tokens": 2257, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1760}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 26}}
